#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:163
msgid "FAQ(s)"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:168
msgid "How can we submit a review to a group using this plugin?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:172
msgid ""
"When visiting the \"/groups\" section in the site, go for single group view "
"page, there you can see a menu namely, \"Reviews\" that will allow you if "
"you are a site member to add group review."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:181
msgid "How to allow users to give multiple reviews on the same group?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:185
msgid ""
"A new functionality \"Multiple Review\" is added to this version of the "
"plugin. In general settings, you can enable or disable it."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:194
msgid ""
"If I don't want to provide review functionality to any group, then what will "
"I do?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:198
msgid ""
"If you don't want to provide review functionality to any group, you can "
"exclude that group for this functionality. For exclude, the plugin has "
"option to exclude groups in the General tab. Here, you exclude one or more "
"groups from reviews."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:207
msgid "How to hide some rating criteria from Review form?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:211
msgid "You can hide criteria by disable criteria in 'Criteria' tab."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:220
msgid ""
"How change label of 'Reviews' tab or label of 'Reviews' sub-tab under "
"'Manage' tab?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:224
msgid ""
"This plugin provides settings to change labels, you can see settings in "
"plugin's settings 'Display' tab."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:233
msgid "Why 'Add Review' option is not displaying in a group created by me?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:237
msgid ""
"This option is not displaying because group admin can't review own group, "
"you can add the review to only that groups in which you are not the admin."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:246
msgid ""
"How to display groups average reviews according to reviews or ratings in "
"sidebar or footer?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:250
msgid ""
"This plugin provides a widget to show average ratings or reviews of "
"BuddyPress Groups, you can use it for display average rating & reviews."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:259
msgid "How can I use the review form on any other page?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:263
msgid ""
"Yes, you can use the review form on other page, just copy shortcode from "
"review setting page and paste it on the other page."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:272
msgid "Where do I ask for support?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:276
msgid ""
"Please visit <a href=\"http://wbcomdesigns.com/contact\" rel=\"nofollow\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Wbcom Designs</a> for any query related to plugin and "
"BuddyPress."
msgstr ""

